---------------------------------

src/nav.ts: the sphere-sheet projection (the sphere out to 45 degrees, then the hyperbolic sheet)
follows Coin's SbSphereSheetProjector, src/projectors/SbSphereSheetProjector.cpp in
https://github.com/coin3d/coin. Copyright (c) Kongsberg Oil & Gas Technologies AS. BSD-3-Clause; the
licence text is in THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES at the top of the repository.

src/rotation.ts: the Euler-angle conversion that FreeCAD's src/Base/Rotation.cpp borrows from Open
CASCADE Technology's gp/gp_Quaternion.cxx (an algorithm by Ken Shoemake, Graphics Gems IV).
